      "title": "Study on Nitration Reaction of Peat Humic Acid",
      "type": "article",
      "url": "https://openalex.org/works/W2385456928",
      "abstract": "The process of nitration reaction of peat humic acid has been investigated by analyzing the different effect for different reaction condition(such as,reaction time and the concentration of nitric acid).The effects include the contents of nitrogen and nitrate nitrogen,the contents of nitrate nitrogen after alkali hydrolyzation.The yield of the nitration of humic acid will reduce with the increase of nitrate concentration and the extension of the reaction time.The value of E4/E6 will increase;it proved that there is an oxidative degradation reaction of the humic acid in the process of nitration reaction.The max value of the nitrate nitrogen shows that the nitration mostly occurs on the aroma nuclear of the humic acid.",
